</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The hour is drawing nigh,</l><l>Soon we shall hear Thy cry</l><l>And with Thee on the clouds descend.</l><l>Oh what an hour sweet</l><l>When Bride and Bridegroom meet</l><l>And love surpassing comprehend.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The moments fly apace,</l><l>Soon we shall see Thy face!</l><l>Amen, Lord Jesus! Quickly come!</l><l>We long Thyself to see</l><l>And with Thee ever be,</l><l>Thou who our inmost heart hath won.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>’Tis but a moment now;</l><l>Thou, our Lord Bridegroom, Thou</l><l>Soon wilt return to claim Thy Bride.</l><l>O Hallelujah!</l><l>’Tis this we long for,</l><l>And Thou too wilt be satisfied.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
